{
  "page_id": "SR-29",
  "section_header": "STEERING — Power Steering",
  "title": "DISASSEMBLY OF GEAR HOUSING",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(See page SR-27)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Gear housing clamped in vise showing internal gears and rack mechanism with reference number 25633",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 5,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "1. CLAMP GEAR HOUSING IN VISE"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "The rack housing is made of aluminum, so always use soft jaws on the vise and clamp onto the part shown in the figure.",
        "If clamping onto the center tube, wrap a piece of cloth around it and be careful not to damage the tube."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Rack and pinion assembly showing SST tool locations for removing turn pressure tubes",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 27,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "2. REMOVE TURN PRESSURE RIGHT AND LEFT TUBES AND UNION SEATS"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) Using SST, remove the turn pressure tubes."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09633-22020",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Remove the union seats."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Tie rod end assembly showing matchmarks for alignment, with reference number 25710",
      "labels": [
        "Marks"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 48,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3. REMOVE TIE ROD ENDS"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) Place matchmarks on the tie rod end and rack end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Loosen the clamp and remove the tie rod end from the rack end."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "4. REMOVE RACK BOOTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Rack assembly showing SST tool positions for removing rack guide spring cap lock nut, with reference number 25508",
      "labels": [
        "SST",
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 70,
        "left": 5,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "5. REMOVE RACK GUIDE SPRING CAP LOCK NUT"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Using SST, remove the rack guide spring cap lock nut."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09612-24012",
      "description": "09617-24020"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "6. REMOVE RACK GUIDE SPRING CAP"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Using SST, remove the rack guide spring cap."
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09612-24012",
      "description": "09612-10021"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "7. REMOVE RACK GUIDE SPRING"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "8. REMOVE RACK GUIDE AND SEAT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "9. REMOVE DUST COVER"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "10. REMOVE CONTROL VALVE HOUSING"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) Place matchmarks on the control valve housing and rack housing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Remove the three bolts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) Remove the control valve housing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(d) Remove the O-ring."
    }
  ]
}
